# Test, build, play

Do not add GUT, gdUnit, Makefile targets, or npm test scripts. Use the existing commands:

```powershell
.\scripts\test.ps1
.\scripts\build.ps1
.\scripts\play.ps1
```

Headless tests live in `tests/run_tests.gd`: `extends SceneTree`, work from `_init` / deferred `_start`, always `quit(code)`, print `TEST_RESULT: PASS`.

```gdscript
❌ extends Node
❌ func _run():  # EditorScript only; -s hangs with no output
✅ extends SceneTree
✅ func _init() -> void:
✅     call_deferred("_start")
```

`godot --check-only` and missing `-s` paths can still exit 0. Gate on `TEST_RESULT: PASS` and fail on `SCRIPT ERROR` / `Parse Error`. Ignore benign `ObjectDB` leak warnings.

Export preset name is `WindowsDesktop` (no space). `builds/latest/IcarusAI.exe` may be locked if the game is running; the build must still succeed and keep the new exe under `builds/windows/`.

Do not run `--import` while Summer is open. It hijacks the local API token/port.
